WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.893
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.163 --> 00:19.416
[theme music playing]

3
00:26.549 --> 00:28.008
[liquid bubbling]

4
00:32.763 --> 00:35.432
[clinking, rattling]

5
00:35.516 --> 00:36.684
[cat meows]

6
00:37.560 --> 00:39.728
[hoofbeats]

7
00:41.397 --> 00:42.273
[water splashes]

8
00:49.154 --> 00:51.156
[handcuffs rattling, click]

9
00:55.202 --> 00:57.288
TAEKANG MITAN MEDICAL CENTER

10
00:57.371 --> 00:59.331
[siren wailing]

11
00:59.415 --> 01:01.667
[medical monitor beeping]

12
01:03.043 --> 01:05.004
Her X-ray and blood work all look good.

13
01:05.629 --> 01:08.716
[doctor] The wound isn't infected, and there are no signs of fracture.

14
01:09.341 --> 01:11.427
But the bruising will last a few days.

15
01:15.389 --> 01:19.435
[soft pensive music playing]

16
01:26.775 --> 01:27.776
[Yi-jun sighs]

17
01:28.485 --> 01:30.112
He said things are looking good.

18
01:32.823 --> 01:34.742
Since you're okay, I have to know.

19
01:37.536 --> 01:38.787
Kang Jae-hee, are you a man…

20
01:42.166 --> 01:43.626
or are you a woman?

21
01:49.381 --> 01:50.382
[sighs]

22
01:51.133 --> 01:52.092
I'm sorry, sir.

23
01:52.176 --> 01:54.011
Don't apologize, just answer me!

24
01:56.513 --> 01:57.932
Were you lying all along?

25
02:02.686 --> 02:03.604
[sighs]

26
02:10.444 --> 02:13.447
[breathes heavily]

27
02:16.158 --> 02:17.451
[soft gasp]

28
02:18.535 --> 02:21.288
[grunting]

29
02:22.581 --> 02:25.000
[siren wailing]

30
02:28.170 --> 02:30.297
Wait, sir! [panting]

31
02:30.381 --> 02:32.800
Just hold on a minute. [groans]

32
02:32.883 --> 02:33.801
[Jae-hee] Sir, please wait.

33
02:36.261 --> 02:37.763
I'll tell you everything.

34
02:42.226 --> 02:43.978
I'm sorry I lied to you.

35
02:44.436 --> 02:45.771
You're "sorry"?

36
02:46.397 --> 02:47.398
You're "sorry"?

37
02:48.357 --> 02:51.944
Lying to my face, covering yourself in bindings, was that fun?

38
02:52.027 --> 02:54.196
Did you enjoy seeing me lose my mind?

39
02:54.279 --> 02:57.449
You watched me go crazy for you while you pretended to be a man.

40
02:58.701 --> 03:00.202
And you're "sorry"?

41
03:00.285 --> 03:02.871
-[car approaching] -[tires screeching]

42
03:02.955 --> 03:04.957
-I had my reasons for doing it, sir. -[Da-woon] Sir!

43
03:05.040 --> 03:07.001
-[footsteps approaching] -Sir!

44
03:07.084 --> 03:09.420
Sir, are… are you okay, sir?

45
03:09.503 --> 03:12.256
How did this accident happen? Huh?

46
03:12.339 --> 03:13.173
Mr. Kang!

47
03:14.550 --> 03:16.552
How did your face end up like that?

48
03:16.635 --> 03:18.012
What happened? I…

49
03:18.095 --> 03:19.179
Just go.

50
03:20.472 --> 03:23.017
Uh, the head of the hospital is waiting for you.

51
03:23.100 --> 03:25.394
-Let me take you to the main branch. -I said go.

52
03:25.477 --> 03:27.479
Just keep the press in check so none of this leaks.

53
03:34.153 --> 03:37.072
[Da-woon] Our Public Relations Team is already on the case, sir.

54
03:40.492 --> 03:43.328
-[car door opens, closes] -[gentle somber music playing]

55
03:44.538 --> 03:45.539
[sighs]

56
03:52.337 --> 03:53.422
Is this the place?

57
03:54.089 --> 03:55.132
I think we're here.

58
03:57.301 --> 03:58.886
Oh, right.

59
03:59.636 --> 04:01.263
Thank you for giving me a ride.

60
04:03.348 --> 04:04.183
[seat belt clicks]

61
04:09.772 --> 04:12.441
Well, sir… I guess I'll go inside now.

62
04:24.745 --> 04:27.414
-[Jae-hee breathing heavily] -[somber music playing]

63
04:29.708 --> 04:31.376
[engine starts]

64
04:41.762 --> 04:43.347
[exhales heavily]

65
04:45.641 --> 04:46.642
[sighs]

66
05:03.492 --> 05:04.409
[Jae-hee] Sir!

67
05:06.912 --> 05:08.080
[Yi-jun] Kang Jae-hee.

68
05:08.914 --> 05:10.999
[tires screeching]

69
05:17.756 --> 05:21.009
[Yi-jun] Kang Jae-hee, are you a man or are you a woman?

70
05:23.053 --> 05:24.471
Were you lying all along?

71
05:28.058 --> 05:29.184
[sighs]

72
05:38.277 --> 05:40.529
EPISODE 9

73
05:45.993 --> 05:47.995
They lost the pen? Are you sure?

74
05:48.328 --> 05:50.455
Going after the car out in the open like that?

75
05:50.539 --> 05:51.790
They must've been desperate.

76
05:51.874 --> 05:54.501
What about the dash cam? Was there anything?

77
05:54.585 --> 05:57.504
I don't know. They took the cam from the car.

78
05:58.088 --> 06:00.090
[sighs] What are we going to do?

79
06:02.384 --> 06:04.136
What about Mr. Yoon and Mr. Kang?

80
06:04.219 --> 06:06.930
They were really lucky. They weren't hurt too bad.

81
06:10.767 --> 06:11.602
Um…

82
06:12.019 --> 06:14.438
I heard he was taken to the hospital, though.

83
06:14.521 --> 06:18.150
Well, Mr. Kang was driving the car, and he's got a bruise or two.

84
06:18.817 --> 06:21.111
As for Mr. Yoon… well, he's even luckier.

85
06:23.822 --> 06:25.282
You don't have to be concerned.

86
06:28.076 --> 06:29.494
Which one are you worried about?

87
06:29.578 --> 06:30.787
Give it to me straight.

88
06:30.871 --> 06:32.581
These love triangles are complicated.

89
06:35.584 --> 06:36.710
It's gonna be okay.

90
06:40.881 --> 06:41.882
Can I help?

91
06:42.633 --> 06:44.134
I can do it myself.

92
06:53.769 --> 06:57.481
-[elevator doors open] -[low suspenseful music playing]

93
07:12.454 --> 07:13.956
[drawer slides shut]

94
07:14.039 --> 07:15.457
[Wan-gu] Kim Hak-ju, age 30.

95
07:15.540 --> 07:16.375
CHAIRMAN NA MAN-SEOK

96
07:16.458 --> 07:18.502
As part of their inmate social reintegration project,

97
07:18.585 --> 07:20.796
Taekang Foundation assigns a couple of ex-cons

98
07:20.879 --> 07:22.756
to its subsidiaries and partners,

99
07:22.839 --> 07:24.007
and he was one of them.

100
07:26.677 --> 07:30.264
I know ex-cons who find themselves a job have a low repeat offense rate,

101
07:30.347 --> 07:31.890
but in this case,

102
07:31.974 --> 07:34.351
the date is what bothers me.

103
07:35.602 --> 07:37.813
The day Han Eun-young was murdered…

104
07:37.896 --> 07:40.440
-happens to be the day he quit his job. -[shushes]

105
07:40.524 --> 07:41.358
[beeps]

106
07:41.441 --> 07:42.859
[whispers] He just came out.

107
07:45.153 --> 07:46.655
[Captain Park] Tail him. Tail him!

108
07:54.121 --> 07:54.955
[Seok-jin] Stop!

109
07:55.038 --> 07:55.872
-Ah, shit! -Ah, damn it!

110
07:55.956 --> 07:57.582
[suspenseful music playing]

111
07:57.916 --> 07:59.084
[both grunt]

112
07:59.167 --> 08:00.836
[Captain Park] Go after him! Hurry!

113
08:00.919 --> 08:01.878
[sighs]

114
08:01.962 --> 08:02.921
[grunts]

115
08:06.591 --> 08:07.509
[grunts]

116
08:09.177 --> 08:10.178
Whoa!

117
08:10.262 --> 08:12.848
You're not getting away from me! Stop!

118
08:12.931 --> 08:13.932
-[scrapes] -[Wan-gu groans]

119
08:14.016 --> 08:15.183
[strained grunts]

120
08:16.059 --> 08:17.686
[grunts, groans]

121
08:18.228 --> 08:20.063
-[Wan-gu exhales, groans] -[Seok-jin] Wan-gu!

122
08:20.939 --> 08:22.649
[both grunting]

123
08:29.573 --> 08:30.699
[groaning]

124
08:32.034 --> 08:33.660
-[Captain Park] Oopsie. -[grunting]

125
08:34.661 --> 08:35.662
Are you okay?

126
08:35.746 --> 08:37.039
[Seok-jin] I'm okay.

127
08:40.417 --> 08:42.336
-[groaning] -[taser crackling]

128
08:43.378 --> 08:45.172
Uh, really? Hang on.

129
08:45.589 --> 08:46.715
Hey, hey, don't move, no.

130
08:46.798 --> 08:48.425
No, no, no. No, no. Here.

131
08:48.508 --> 08:49.926
-[Seok-jin] Are you all right? -[Wan-gu groans]

132
08:50.010 --> 08:50.927
[taser crackling]

133
08:52.429 --> 08:53.722
[Captain Park] Sheesh.

134
08:53.805 --> 08:55.474
-Detective! -[detective] Sir.

135
08:55.557 --> 08:58.143
I gave you one of these for a reason. Why didn't you use it?

136
08:58.935 --> 08:59.770
You okay?

137
09:00.562 --> 09:01.980
[Captain Park] Kim Hak-ju, you're under arrest

138
09:02.064 --> 09:05.067
for the suspicion of murder and for attempted murder.

139
09:05.150 --> 09:07.569
[tense music playing]

140
09:26.713 --> 09:27.589
[choking]

141
09:29.925 --> 09:31.426
[elevator chiming]

142
09:31.510 --> 09:32.511
[strained grunt]

143
09:33.637 --> 09:36.848
[handcuffs rattling]

144
09:37.474 --> 09:39.559
[groans, panting]

145
09:39.643 --> 09:40.894
Still can't reach Kang?

146
09:40.977 --> 09:43.230
No. She's not picking up. I'll head over there.

147
09:43.313 --> 09:44.856
[Captain Park] Tell her it's all over.

148
09:44.940 --> 09:46.483
She can stop babysitting.

149
09:47.192 --> 09:48.151
I'll tell her, sir.

150
09:53.198 --> 09:54.116
[Yi-jun sighs]

151
09:54.950 --> 09:56.201
[breathes sharply]

152
09:57.035 --> 09:58.995
[inhales deeply]

153
10:01.540 --> 10:02.707
[exhales deeply]

154
10:03.458 --> 10:05.794
[pensive music playing]

155
10:05.877 --> 10:06.711
[Yi-jun] Tell me…

156
10:06.795 --> 10:08.922
were you always misunderstood?

157
10:09.714 --> 10:10.715
In the military?

158
10:11.550 --> 10:12.801
Did anybody ask you on a date?

159
10:13.343 --> 10:14.511
I think we'll be coming by the hospital--

160
10:14.594 --> 10:15.804
I don't need to go to the hospital.

161
10:15.887 --> 10:17.389
Special Forces, are you okay?

162
10:20.142 --> 10:21.226
[officer] Here's what I need from you.

163
10:21.309 --> 10:23.228
-ID number and your name. -[sighs]

164
10:24.563 --> 10:25.564
[sighs]

165
10:25.647 --> 10:27.691
[Yi-jun] Remember when we met

166
10:27.774 --> 10:29.568
and I said that I would have fallen for you

167
10:29.651 --> 10:30.694
if you were a woman?

168
10:33.613 --> 10:34.990
What are we doing? We're both men.

169
10:35.407 --> 10:37.742
[Yi-jun] If one of us were a different gender…

170
10:37.826 --> 10:39.411
if one of us were a woman…

171
10:40.745 --> 10:42.372
would you want to be together?

172
10:45.542 --> 10:46.543
[inhales]

173
10:47.586 --> 10:49.713
I don't understand why…

174
10:50.255 --> 10:52.632
[breathes sharply]

175
10:54.551 --> 10:57.637
[tires screeching]

176
10:59.890 --> 11:02.893
[engine revving]

177
11:04.936 --> 11:07.272
[engine accelerating]

178
11:14.738 --> 11:15.822
[sighs]

179
11:18.825 --> 11:20.702
I still owe him a proper apology.

180
11:22.913 --> 11:24.664
[grunts, exhales]

181
11:25.832 --> 11:29.211
[footsteps approaching]

182
11:31.671 --> 11:32.714
Seok-jin.

183
11:32.797 --> 11:33.882
You wouldn't pick up.

184
11:35.383 --> 11:36.384
Are you all right?

185
11:41.640 --> 11:44.726
Well, all things considered, I'm glad we got him.

186
11:44.809 --> 11:45.977
You just let him get you?

187
11:47.437 --> 11:50.774
-It wasn't so bad, the bulletproof vest-- -Would you listen to yourself?

188
11:59.074 --> 12:00.116
What happened?

189
12:03.036 --> 12:04.246
Why didn't you move out of the way?

190
12:04.871 --> 12:06.122
You could've dodged him.

191
12:09.000 --> 12:10.043
[sighs]

192
12:10.126 --> 12:11.461
He found out I'm a woman.

193
12:13.797 --> 12:15.423
I think I owe him an apology.

194
12:17.133 --> 12:19.386
I should ask for his forgiveness.

195
12:20.011 --> 12:21.179
What'll you tell him next?

196
12:21.763 --> 12:23.682
"I'm also a cop, working undercover."

197
12:23.765 --> 12:24.808
Can you tell him that?

198
12:25.892 --> 12:28.895
Look, we did what we set out to do. The investigation's over.

199
12:43.118 --> 12:43.994
[sighs]

200
12:45.745 --> 12:46.955
[Seok-jin] Maybe it's a good thing.

201
12:47.038 --> 12:49.207
Now that the cat's out of the bag, you can resign.

202
12:50.834 --> 12:54.254
Just like it began, you can end this whole thing cleanly.

203
13:00.594 --> 13:01.428
Kang Jae-hee.

204
13:06.558 --> 13:08.184
I care about you a lot.

205
13:10.520 --> 13:12.606
And I care about you and our team.

206
13:13.023 --> 13:14.274
You all mean a lot to me.

207
13:14.357 --> 13:15.483
That's not what I meant.

208
13:17.736 --> 13:20.030
I hate when you're in danger like this.

209
13:20.113 --> 13:21.615
I hate that you had to play a guy.

210
13:24.409 --> 13:25.744
I want to be with you…

211
13:27.579 --> 13:29.247
as a man, not an officer.

212
13:33.126 --> 13:34.127
Seok-jin, I…

213
13:38.715 --> 13:39.549
I…

214
13:41.092 --> 13:42.260
[Jae-hee] I'm in love…

215
13:47.140 --> 13:48.224
I'm in love…

216
13:48.725 --> 13:52.228
[somber music playing]

217
13:58.109 --> 13:59.611
…with Yoon Yi-jun.

218
14:01.279 --> 14:04.699
I didn't dodge that knife 'cause I wanted to protect him.

219
14:07.577 --> 14:08.745
[door thuds]

220
14:13.124 --> 14:15.043
-No, wait a minute… -[car door closes]

221
14:15.543 --> 14:16.628
Sorry, Seok-jin.

222
14:18.880 --> 14:21.299
[car engine revving]

223
14:21.716 --> 14:22.759
[Jae-hee] Sir…

224
14:24.636 --> 14:25.679
Wait a minute!

225
14:26.554 --> 14:27.681
Wait, come back!

226
14:28.723 --> 14:31.226
[somber music continues]

227
14:42.946 --> 14:44.948
[Jae-hee] I… I'm in love…

228
14:45.031 --> 14:48.159
[somber music continues]

229
14:59.713 --> 15:00.755
I'm in love…

230
15:08.930 --> 15:10.390
[engine accelerating]

231
15:22.068 --> 15:24.070
-[button beeps] -[phone buzzing]

232
15:28.491 --> 15:29.409
Yes, Detective?

233
15:30.952 --> 15:31.870
You got him?

234
15:34.998 --> 15:36.541
He's from the foundation?

235
15:36.624 --> 15:37.834
Did you happen to, um…

236
15:38.668 --> 15:41.546
come across a recording pen or a dashcam memory card?

237
15:45.508 --> 15:48.094
I understand. Thank you for calling me.

238
15:56.227 --> 15:58.897
[coffee machine whirring]

239
15:59.689 --> 16:00.565
What are you doing?

240
16:00.648 --> 16:02.859
-[coffee sloshing] -Well, you said they caught the guy.

241
16:03.735 --> 16:05.153
I should head back to my house now.

242
16:05.236 --> 16:06.279
So soon?

243
16:06.362 --> 16:07.906
You expect me to stay here?

244
16:08.364 --> 16:10.200
You want me to move in and mooch off you for good?

245
16:10.784 --> 16:12.619
Um, I just finished your laundry.

246
16:13.286 --> 16:15.538
It's gonna take a while for your clothes to dry.

247
16:15.622 --> 16:16.539
[soft chuckle]

248
16:16.623 --> 16:18.458
Right out of the woodcutter's playbook…

249
16:19.000 --> 16:21.085
I'll let you be my fairy, so just stay here.

250
16:21.169 --> 16:22.003
It's the weekend.

251
16:22.086 --> 16:24.464
Hmm… People are gonna talk, though.

252
16:25.298 --> 16:26.800
When did you care about that?

253
16:26.883 --> 16:28.176
You're right, I don't.

254
16:28.259 --> 16:29.969
I was looking out for your public image, is all.

255
16:31.429 --> 16:33.264
It doesn't only apply to women.

256
16:33.348 --> 16:35.433
Men should behave themselves as well, you know,

257
16:35.517 --> 16:36.601
if they want to find a good wife.

258
16:46.402 --> 16:47.904
Didn't you say you couldn't live there?

259
16:47.987 --> 16:49.489
'Cause it reminds you what happened.

260
16:49.572 --> 16:50.907
Honestly, it even scares me.

261
16:51.324 --> 16:52.325
I'm gonna move out.

262
16:52.826 --> 16:54.953
I'm meeting a realtor already, so I can't cancel.

263
16:55.453 --> 16:57.580
-I'll come with you. -Why would you?

264
16:59.040 --> 17:01.042
I thought you were gonna meet Mr. Yoon today.

265
17:02.794 --> 17:05.672
Hye-jung, forgive me for being curious…

266
17:12.804 --> 17:14.556
what are we to each other?

267
17:14.639 --> 17:16.641
[gentle pensive music playing]

268
17:19.602 --> 17:22.021
[upbeat music playing on TV]

269
17:25.483 --> 17:26.985
[phone buzzing]

270
17:27.068 --> 17:28.111
SPECIAL FORCES

271
17:28.987 --> 17:30.071
[sighs]

272
17:35.410 --> 17:36.703
[Yi-jun sighs]

273
17:36.786 --> 17:38.496
[phone buzzing]

274
17:38.580 --> 17:40.039
SPECIAL FORCES

275
17:46.588 --> 17:47.964
[doorbell chimes]

276
17:50.466 --> 17:51.843
Sir, this is Kang Jae-hee.

277
17:53.052 --> 17:54.095
Can you please open the door?

278
17:55.263 --> 17:57.181
-[gate rattling] -Just let me in!

279
17:58.433 --> 17:59.934
Please open the door!

280
18:01.978 --> 18:02.854
[sighs]

281
18:03.938 --> 18:05.023
[doorbell chimes]

282
18:05.732 --> 18:07.233
I'm sorry for everything.

283
18:08.234 --> 18:10.194
Please let me apologize face to face.

284
18:11.529 --> 18:12.822
I'm really sorry.

285
18:14.073 --> 18:15.992
[Jae-hee] Give me a chance. I'll explain everything, sir.

286
18:16.075 --> 18:17.702
Sure is nice outside.

287
18:19.454 --> 18:21.873
Makes you wonder why it feels like Siberia in here.

288
18:21.956 --> 18:23.708
[wind whistling effect]

289
18:24.834 --> 18:27.462
-[Si-hyun] Hmm… -[playful music playing]

290
18:29.464 --> 18:30.298
You do it?

291
18:30.924 --> 18:32.258
Don't make fun of me.

292
18:32.342 --> 18:34.510
Hmm, wonder why you're being so prickly.

293
18:34.594 --> 18:35.720
What are you, a hedgehog?

294
18:36.596 --> 18:38.723
One, you asked him out. Two, he said no.

295
18:38.806 --> 18:41.017
Three, you fired him out of embarrassment.

296
18:41.100 --> 18:42.477
[sucks teeth] That's not it.

297
18:42.560 --> 18:44.312
One, you asked him out. Two, he said no.

298
18:44.395 --> 18:47.482
Three, you got clingy, and he rejected you again?

299
18:49.233 --> 18:51.402
-[whimpers] That's not what happened. -[baby cries effect]

300
18:51.945 --> 18:53.196
Uh…

301
18:53.279 --> 18:55.406
-[sobs] -Whoa, are you crying?

302
18:55.990 --> 18:59.118
-You're just a mess. Hey… -[sobbing]

303
18:59.202 --> 19:01.162
Oh, what's wrong? It's gonna be all right.

304
19:01.245 --> 19:04.332
Why don't we both take a seat? Hey, hey.

305
19:04.415 --> 19:05.708
What happened? Huh?

306
19:05.792 --> 19:06.876
He really…

307
19:08.252 --> 19:11.339
[sniffles] …kicked me while I was down and it really hurts.

308
19:11.923 --> 19:14.092
He said he loves someone else.

309
19:14.175 --> 19:15.551
There, there.

310
19:15.635 --> 19:17.011
Mr. Kang said that?

311
19:17.095 --> 19:18.262
Oh, chin up.

312
19:21.015 --> 19:23.685
Hearing him say that he loves someone else…

313
19:23.768 --> 19:27.021
that really hurt me m-more than anything I've ever heard.

314
19:27.105 --> 19:28.356
I'm sure it did, yeah.

315
19:28.439 --> 19:29.774
Why… why don't you blow your nose?

316
19:30.608 --> 19:32.860
-Blow. Blow… -[inhales, blows nose]

317
19:32.944 --> 19:34.570
There you go. There it is.

318
19:34.654 --> 19:36.280
-[sniffles] -There, there.

319
19:36.364 --> 19:37.532
-Hmm? -Thank you.

320
19:38.366 --> 19:39.492
Ugh…

321
19:39.575 --> 19:41.536
-Guess you were really sad. -[hiccups]

322
19:42.537 --> 19:44.163
-[Si-hyun] Look at it like this… -[sniffles]

323
19:44.247 --> 19:46.332
This is where Mr. Kang works, right?

324
19:46.416 --> 19:49.002
If his boss treated him a certain way, it could get weird.

325
19:49.627 --> 19:50.545
Yeah.

326
19:50.628 --> 19:52.672
That's why he was so tricky.

327
19:52.755 --> 19:53.631
Just for the money.

328
19:54.382 --> 19:55.258
In the end…

329
19:56.217 --> 19:57.552
[sniffles] …I meant…

330
19:59.387 --> 20:02.640
absolutely nothing to him at all. [groans]

331
20:03.516 --> 20:04.684
Oh, um…

332
20:05.184 --> 20:07.562
-You used this side, right? -[sobbing]

333
20:07.645 --> 20:09.063
Uh, here… here you go. Yep.

334
20:11.232 --> 20:13.401
[sniffles] I blew my nose on that.

335
20:13.901 --> 20:15.653
I flipped it. I flipped it.

336
20:15.737 --> 20:18.573
-[radio beeping] -[officer] Unit 19, copy.

337
20:18.656 --> 20:19.949
[radio beeping]

338
20:20.033 --> 20:21.576
CSI on the scene, over.

339
20:22.201 --> 20:25.204
[camera shutter clicking]

340
20:26.497 --> 20:28.332
[clanking]

341
20:30.376 --> 20:31.878
[Wan-gu] Ah, herbicide, check.

342
20:42.013 --> 20:42.847
[Wan-gu scoffs]

343
20:43.306 --> 20:45.308
And a leftie, that checks out.

344
20:45.391 --> 20:46.976
[plastic bag rustling]

345
20:47.060 --> 20:49.896
You never have to answer another question, for all I care.

346
20:49.979 --> 20:52.356
Kim Hak-ju, you're dead meat now.

347
20:55.485 --> 20:57.779
PARK MIN-HWAN, LEE HYE-JUNG, HAN EUN-YOUNG

348
20:59.530 --> 21:01.240
Ugh, what's up with you?

349
21:01.949 --> 21:03.242
You may not know this…

350
21:03.326 --> 21:06.537
but when something bugs you, it also bugs me too.

351
21:06.621 --> 21:09.540
All this evidence is weird. It's too convenient.

352
21:11.918 --> 21:14.629
It's almost like someone really wanted us to find it.

353
21:14.712 --> 21:16.297
-[phone buzzing] -[sighs]

354
21:17.799 --> 21:18.883
Yes, Captain?

355
21:20.009 --> 21:21.844
Huh? Kim Hak-ju did what?

356
21:21.928 --> 21:23.387
[tense music playing]

357
21:25.932 --> 21:27.850
[officer] Hey, are you okay?

358
21:28.768 --> 21:31.729
We have a man down! Call 119. Hurry!

359
21:33.314 --> 21:34.232
He's dead.

360
21:39.237 --> 21:40.363
Oh, dear.

361
21:41.781 --> 21:42.990
Now that's a shame.

362
21:43.908 --> 21:45.076
Ugh, well…

363
21:46.869 --> 21:49.038
now that you have all the evidence you need…

364
21:54.585 --> 21:57.922
"A repeat offender who, burdened by the guilt of his murder,

365
21:58.005 --> 21:59.132
punished himself"?

366
21:59.215 --> 22:01.008
[Mr. Na] That should paint the picture.

367
22:01.092 --> 22:03.511
But if that pen isn't in evidence…

368
22:03.928 --> 22:06.139
Mr. Yoon is going to go looking for it again.

369
22:06.806 --> 22:07.723
[scoffs]

370
22:11.561 --> 22:14.647
I doubt… he'll have the time.

371
22:17.316 --> 22:19.569
We'll just cover one scandal with another.

372
22:26.534 --> 22:27.577
[sighs]

373
22:30.037 --> 22:31.080
[phone buzzes]

374
22:34.292 --> 22:35.209
[gasps]

375
22:35.751 --> 22:37.461
Oh, my God, this is insane!

376
22:39.547 --> 22:41.549
[secretary] Looks like the rumors were true.

377
22:42.425 --> 22:43.426
[secretary exclaims]

378
22:44.552 --> 22:46.470
-[indistinct chatter] -[gasps]

379
22:46.554 --> 22:47.805
[employee 1] Yo, check it out!

380
22:47.889 --> 22:49.515
-[employee 2] You see the socials yet? -[employee 3] No.

381
22:49.974 --> 22:51.100
[employee 4] Man, I knew it!

382
22:51.642 --> 22:52.768
[employee 5] Is that really him?

383
22:52.852 --> 22:54.270
[employee 6 gasps] Looks like it!

384
22:54.353 --> 22:55.479
Isn't this Mr. Yoon?

385
22:58.357 --> 22:59.483
[employee 7] That's Mr. Kang.

386
22:59.567 --> 23:00.818
-[employee 8] Really? -[employee 9] Holy crap.

387
23:00.902 --> 23:02.028
-Is this for real? -I knew I was getting weird vibes

388
23:02.111 --> 23:03.779
-from them. -No wonder they're always stuck together.

389
23:04.697 --> 23:06.782
[Mr. Na] There's an article you should see, sir.

390
23:06.866 --> 23:09.577
[tense music playing]

391
23:14.165 --> 23:16.083
MANAGING DIRECTOR YOON KISSING HIS MALE SECRETARY?

392
23:19.086 --> 23:20.129
Bring him to me.

393
23:20.838 --> 23:21.756
Of course, sir.

394
23:28.512 --> 23:29.472
[sighs]

395
23:42.985 --> 23:44.028
[car doors close]

396
23:46.948 --> 23:48.366
The chairman wants to see you.

397
23:48.449 --> 23:49.659
Oh, Mr. Yoon, uh--

398
23:49.742 --> 23:52.828
We haven't come for Mr. Yoon. It's you the chairman wants to see.

399
23:55.081 --> 23:56.832
Do you mean Chairman Yoon Tae-sik?

400
23:56.916 --> 23:58.751
Please turn off your phone for the time being.

401
23:59.126 --> 24:01.212
Try not to make this harder than it has to be.

402
24:10.304 --> 24:13.641
[Si-hyun] Damage control aside, you should stop the chairman first.

403
24:14.058 --> 24:14.892
Get a grip.

404
24:15.434 --> 24:17.019
He just summoned Mr. Kang.

405
24:21.274 --> 24:23.734
The chairman himself is getting involved now.

406
24:23.818 --> 24:25.611
-So what? -"So what"?

407
24:26.737 --> 24:28.114
Good for him, then.

408
24:28.197 --> 24:30.408
These rumors have totally stressed him out.

409
24:31.367 --> 24:33.286
What better way to clear up a misunderstanding

410
24:33.369 --> 24:34.453
than coming clean to my father?

411
24:35.746 --> 24:36.831
Jun.

412
24:36.914 --> 24:41.002
You know what the ramifications are better than anyone, no?

413
24:41.502 --> 24:43.462
[breathes sharply]

414
24:43.546 --> 24:46.173
[laughing]

415
24:46.257 --> 24:47.925
EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR YOON NA-JUNG

416
24:48.009 --> 24:51.012
Oh, he must be out of his mind! Ugh!

417
24:51.846 --> 24:53.931
Digging his own grave like a dumbass.

418
24:54.015 --> 24:57.059
[laughing continues]

419
24:58.185 --> 25:01.272
Just imagine it, the fit dear old Dad will throw.

420
25:01.355 --> 25:03.232
I need to get front-row seats!

421
25:03.316 --> 25:05.234
[laughs]

422
25:05.318 --> 25:07.778
TAEKANG GROUP CHAIRMAN'S OFFICE

423
25:14.493 --> 25:17.663
[breathes deeply]

424
25:17.747 --> 25:18.581
[gasps]

425
25:18.664 --> 25:20.499
[tense music playing]

426
25:26.547 --> 25:28.382
[footsteps approaching]

427
25:32.803 --> 25:33.929
Step aside.

428
25:35.056 --> 25:36.724
[breathes heavily]

429
25:43.314 --> 25:44.231
[doors close]

430
25:59.038 --> 25:59.955
[sighs]

431
26:05.544 --> 26:07.380
[Hye-jung] It went viral on the company forums.

432
26:07.880 --> 26:12.093
I figured you might not have seen it yet, since you need a company ID to access it.

433
26:13.886 --> 26:15.471
[sighs]

434
26:17.181 --> 26:20.768
[breathing heavily]

435
26:20.851 --> 26:22.186
Could it be…

436
26:22.937 --> 26:25.773
that Mr. Yoon's found out that you're actually a girl?

437
26:26.690 --> 26:28.025
Was it at the hospital?

438
26:29.360 --> 26:32.738
[inhales] How long have you… known about this?

439
26:34.198 --> 26:35.032
Well, you see,

440
26:35.116 --> 26:37.576
a man who hasn't fallen for me is rare around here.

441
26:41.747 --> 26:43.499
A certain someone recently shared

442
26:43.582 --> 26:45.709
that silly jokes like that help in times like these.

443
26:46.794 --> 26:49.296
You seem really tense right now, so…

444
26:52.258 --> 26:54.135
Thank you for keeping it to yourself.

445
26:55.428 --> 26:57.721
Then were you the one who told Mr. Yoon about this?

446
26:58.264 --> 27:00.266
I know he's on leave 'cause of the crash,

447
27:00.349 --> 27:02.726
but I thought he should know, so I had Mr. Kim pass it on.

448
27:05.479 --> 27:07.314
The recording pen's gone missing,

449
27:07.398 --> 27:09.275
his plan's gone down the drain,

450
27:10.651 --> 27:13.654
and the person that he likes screwed him over.

451
27:14.530 --> 27:16.282
He must be an emotional wreck.

452
27:17.700 --> 27:21.036
[sighs] Personally, I would have just left you to rot,

453
27:21.120 --> 27:22.788
but Mr. Yoon came to your rescue.

454
27:24.874 --> 27:25.875
[sighs]

455
27:27.585 --> 27:28.502
[Na-jung scoffs]

456
27:29.628 --> 27:32.548
You're committed to bringing this company down, aren't you?

457
27:32.631 --> 27:35.050
[tense music playing]

458
27:36.260 --> 27:37.428
Explain yourself.

459
27:38.637 --> 27:40.055
It's exactly as it looks.

460
27:40.556 --> 27:41.974
[Na-jung] See that, Father?

461
27:42.057 --> 27:43.767
He's gone all loony, hasn't he?

462
27:43.851 --> 27:45.728
Don't worry, he doesn't feel the same way.

463
27:46.145 --> 27:46.979
Now this photo…

464
27:47.813 --> 27:50.357
I forced myself on him, so don't go after the wrong person.

465
27:51.275 --> 27:54.195
If you are gonna go after him, at least offer him a giant payout.

466
27:54.278 --> 27:55.696
How dare you! [grunts]

467
28:01.660 --> 28:02.536
You're not sorry?

468
28:08.834 --> 28:09.877
[inhales]

469
28:13.380 --> 28:14.465
Both of you leave.

470
28:16.217 --> 28:18.302
Father, do I have to?

471
28:18.385 --> 28:19.470
[yells] Get out!

472
28:27.269 --> 28:29.688
[door opens, closes]

473
28:29.772 --> 28:31.190
What the hell is wrong with you?

474
28:32.149 --> 28:33.734
What is wrong with you?

475
28:35.027 --> 28:38.113
I've let your insolent behavior slide, but you've forgotten your place.

476
28:38.197 --> 28:40.407
Do you know how much you've cost this company?

477
28:40.491 --> 28:42.535
That's why I've come to clean up my mess.

478
28:44.245 --> 28:45.829
Let's see what you've got in store.

479
28:46.205 --> 28:47.915
It's not like I don't know you, Father.

480
28:49.500 --> 28:51.585
I had her pick an auspicious date.

481
28:53.629 --> 28:54.964
Is that so?

482
28:55.047 --> 28:58.425
I heard Ms. Lee's art gallery will be hosting an event soon.

483
29:00.219 --> 29:03.847
Attend that event with her… and announce your marriage.

484
29:07.851 --> 29:09.603
What I do to that person…

485
29:10.229 --> 29:11.814
is entirely up to you.

486
29:19.947 --> 29:21.865
-[sighs] -[door closes]

487
29:22.491 --> 29:23.617
Sir, wait a minute.

488
29:27.538 --> 29:28.914
[Jae-hee] Sir, we need to talk.

489
29:29.748 --> 29:31.208
I know you're mad at me.

490
29:31.292 --> 29:32.751
I know you're disappointed too.

491
29:32.835 --> 29:35.671
[breathes deeply] I don't need your excuses.

492
29:40.009 --> 29:42.511
I'd gotten used to often being mistaken for a man.

493
29:44.346 --> 29:46.181
So I didn't think it was a big deal.

494
29:47.683 --> 29:49.602
I didn't feel any guilt over it.

495
29:49.685 --> 29:53.147
But… I regretted it as time went by.

496
29:54.315 --> 29:55.399
I was scared.

497
29:55.482 --> 29:57.901
[gentle somber music playing]

498
29:57.985 --> 30:00.821
I knew deep in my heart that I should come clean to you.

499
30:03.073 --> 30:05.326
But I was afraid that it would end everything.

500
30:07.036 --> 30:09.663
So I put it off and avoided it.

501
30:15.210 --> 30:17.338
The real reason I lied to you was because--

502
30:17.421 --> 30:19.423
At least, when you found out how I felt…

503
30:21.550 --> 30:23.719
you should have come clean and told me then.

504
30:28.349 --> 30:29.892
When I told you how I felt…

505
30:31.602 --> 30:33.354
you should have told me the reason.

506
30:36.940 --> 30:38.108
I'm so sorry, sir.

507
30:39.943 --> 30:41.445
I was nothing but a coward.

508
30:42.237 --> 30:43.155
[sniffles]

509
30:44.740 --> 30:45.741
That's right.

510
30:47.159 --> 30:48.243
You were a coward.

511
30:51.330 --> 30:52.373
It's all good.

512
30:53.540 --> 30:57.503
It's not like anything would change if I started blaming you for it now.

513
31:01.590 --> 31:03.676
At least the one thing you could've done…

514
31:05.427 --> 31:07.763
is show me a little bit of courtesy.

515
31:15.396 --> 31:16.814
Let's stop this now.

516
31:18.273 --> 31:19.274
[inhales]

517
31:21.151 --> 31:24.405
[inhales, exhales shakily]

518
31:25.406 --> 31:26.824
[phone buzzing]

519
31:31.036 --> 31:31.912
LEE SI-A

520
31:35.207 --> 31:38.127
[Si-a] You know, the chairman sent me a very valuable gift!

521
31:38.669 --> 31:40.295
[Yi-jun sighs]

522
31:43.173 --> 31:45.008
You should go ahead and choose the wedding date.

523
31:46.802 --> 31:49.388
[chuckles softly] I'm so grateful, you know?

524
31:49.471 --> 31:51.974
Looks like I owe the chairman a favor.

525
31:52.057 --> 31:53.350
On opening day,

526
31:54.017 --> 31:55.269
can you save me a spot?

527
31:55.936 --> 31:57.438
You're welcome anytime.

528
31:58.397 --> 32:01.233
You seem a bit… depressed for someone bearing good news.

529
32:01.316 --> 32:02.151
Why is that?

530
32:03.944 --> 32:05.195
[Si-a] Oh, no.

531
32:06.155 --> 32:07.990
Love hurts, and the truth…

532
32:08.407 --> 32:10.576
well, the thing is, it always breaks your heart.

533
32:17.332 --> 32:18.250
[inhales]

534
32:22.337 --> 32:23.756
Sir, wait…

535
32:32.055 --> 32:33.056
[sighs]

536
32:38.937 --> 32:40.606
-[gasps] -[quirky music playing]

537
32:40.689 --> 32:43.859
Oh, we're pulling the lover-against-the-wall bit, are we?

538
32:43.942 --> 32:45.778
This isn't the time to get butterflies.

539
32:45.861 --> 32:47.946
Why not? I wanna get butterflies.

540
32:48.614 --> 32:49.531
[groans]

541
32:50.449 --> 32:51.700
Why didn't you tell me…

542
32:52.451 --> 32:54.286
that you lost the pen on purpose?

543
32:56.663 --> 32:59.833
Ah, dear, I forgot to review that document we're sending for audit.

544
32:59.917 --> 33:00.959
[inhales]

545
33:01.502 --> 33:04.463
Explain, justify, plead your case, or scream.

546
33:06.715 --> 33:07.549
Did you say "scream"?

547
33:07.633 --> 33:10.677
If I feel that the first three options don't quite cut it for me,

548
33:10.761 --> 33:11.762
I'll take it to that level.

549
33:13.222 --> 33:14.306
How did you find out?

550
33:16.600 --> 33:17.643
[scoffs]

551
33:19.812 --> 33:21.563
[sighs] So I was right.

552
33:22.481 --> 33:24.483
I was only taking a wild guess

553
33:24.566 --> 33:27.361
because neither you nor Mr. Yoon nor Mr. Kang

554
33:27.736 --> 33:29.571
seemed all that worried about losing it.

555
33:31.073 --> 33:31.907
[scoffs]

556
33:36.578 --> 33:39.289
[tense music playing]

557
33:39.373 --> 33:42.167
His efforts to fix the cow's horn…

558
33:43.418 --> 33:44.711
-only… -[cracks]

559
33:44.795 --> 33:46.296
…cost him his cow.

560
33:48.841 --> 33:51.260
My nephew's smart. Why didn't he see this coming?

561
33:59.768 --> 34:02.604
[Min-hwan] About those Treasury security documents you gave me,

562
34:02.688 --> 34:05.524
I went over the FS and provisional adjustment report,

563
34:05.607 --> 34:07.317
but didn't find anything wrong with them.

564
34:08.443 --> 34:11.113
Forget it. Switch focus to the Taekang Foundation.

565
34:11.196 --> 34:12.072
The foundation?

566
34:12.155 --> 34:13.782
Yeah, because ten years ago,

567
34:13.866 --> 34:16.326
my father appointed my uncle to take up its reins.

568
34:16.410 --> 34:19.162
Chief Secretary Na Man-seok will be listed as the chairman.

569
34:19.580 --> 34:21.832
But the Taekang Foundation's huge.

570
34:21.915 --> 34:22.916
[Yi-jun] It is.

571
34:23.000 --> 34:25.794
One of its ventures is the inmate rehabilitation project.

572
34:25.878 --> 34:26.879
Are you saying…

573
34:27.296 --> 34:29.548
they used a series of false identities

574
34:29.631 --> 34:32.634
to transfer the retained earnings through the inmates' accounts?

575
34:33.093 --> 34:35.262
Dig into anything related to that project.

576
34:36.013 --> 34:37.431
I'm sure this will help us.

577
34:37.723 --> 34:38.765
[Min-hwan] Yes, sir.

578
34:39.474 --> 34:40.475
But…

579
34:40.559 --> 34:42.811
how did you know to look into them, sir?

580
34:49.359 --> 34:51.528
[exhales deeply]

581
34:53.405 --> 34:55.490
HONAM MATSIKDANG

582
34:58.619 --> 35:01.622
Well done. You worked hard for this.

583
35:03.040 --> 35:04.458
You helped to bring him in.

584
35:09.296 --> 35:10.422
FOUR DAYS BEFORE THE MEMORIAL

585
35:10.505 --> 35:13.050
Captain, under Yoon Yi-jun's orders,

586
35:13.133 --> 35:15.344
I synced the location of that recording pen to his phone,

587
35:15.427 --> 35:17.262
and also synced it to one of our tablets.

588
35:21.099 --> 35:23.310
Yoon Yi-jun wants to find out exactly whose hands

589
35:23.393 --> 35:24.811
that recording pen ends up in.

590
35:25.103 --> 35:27.773
Yoon Na-jung and Na Man-seok won't sit around and let this happen.

591
35:27.856 --> 35:28.857
You gonna be okay?

592
35:30.233 --> 35:32.069
Wear a bulletproof vest for a while, just in case.

593
35:32.152 --> 35:32.986
That's an order.

594
35:33.070 --> 35:33.904
Sir.

595
35:34.446 --> 35:35.572
I promise you…

596
35:36.907 --> 35:38.533
he's not getting away from me again.

597
35:42.204 --> 35:43.205
Thank you, sir.

598
35:44.539 --> 35:47.250
Let's wrap this case up before the weekend, all right?

599
35:47.834 --> 35:48.919
[bottle thuds]

600
35:49.002 --> 35:49.962
We're closing the case?

601
35:50.045 --> 35:51.505
Kim Hak-ju died in our custody,

602
35:51.588 --> 35:53.799
so one wrong move, and we'll take the fall.

603
35:53.882 --> 35:56.259
We both know Kim Hak-ju isn't the key to this case.

604
35:56.593 --> 35:58.261
They're clearly using him as a scapegoat.

605
35:58.345 --> 36:00.305
We only set out to catch the murderer to begin with,

606
36:00.389 --> 36:02.057
so we'll hand the rest to another team, okay?

607
36:02.140 --> 36:05.018
We even confirmed that Na Man-seok's gotten his hands on the pen.

608
36:05.102 --> 36:07.813
That means we have to investigate him right now, Captain.

609
36:15.779 --> 36:17.280
Why'd you get attached to the guy?

610
36:21.034 --> 36:21.868
[scoffs]

611
36:22.577 --> 36:24.454
That's the riskiest mistake you could've made.

612
36:27.416 --> 36:28.417
Yeah, I know that.

613
36:30.210 --> 36:31.545
I know that all too well, it's just…

614
36:31.628 --> 36:32.838
If you know, then end it now.

615
36:33.588 --> 36:35.507
I'm sure you also know why all too well.

616
36:36.341 --> 36:39.928
Kim Hak-ju's death… that's just way above our pay grade.

617
36:42.764 --> 36:44.850
Wrap it up before Yoon Yi-jun catches on,

618
36:45.183 --> 36:46.935
before the autopsy results are in.

619
36:49.104 --> 36:50.272
[Captain Park sighs]

620
36:51.189 --> 36:52.149
[Jae-hee sighs]

621
36:53.650 --> 36:55.861
[breathes heavily]

622
37:03.160 --> 37:05.162
That Kang Jae-hee character…

623
37:07.330 --> 37:08.415
is actually a girl.

624
37:09.916 --> 37:11.793
You didn't knowingly leave that out, right?

625
37:11.877 --> 37:13.420
Um… Mr. Kang's a girl?

626
37:13.503 --> 37:15.047
[gasps] Huh?

627
37:16.173 --> 37:17.049
Huh?

628
37:17.507 --> 37:20.093
Oh… I didn't know that, Ms. Yoon.

629
37:20.177 --> 37:22.179
-[gasps] Oh… -Huh.

630
37:23.221 --> 37:24.973
Looks like she fooled you all then.

631
37:26.183 --> 37:28.268
Was she gender faking just for the money?

632
37:28.351 --> 37:30.687
If that were the case, she should have accepted my offer,

633
37:30.771 --> 37:32.064
just like you did. You agree?

634
37:32.522 --> 37:33.356
[gasps]

635
37:34.649 --> 37:37.152
Um, Ms. Yoon…

636
37:37.235 --> 37:38.612
[Na-jung] Kang Jae-hee.

637
37:39.196 --> 37:40.405
Kang Jae-hee…

638
37:40.989 --> 37:43.200
Ugh, there's more than meets the eye.

639
37:43.283 --> 37:45.202
[splutters] The detective told me that…

640
37:45.285 --> 37:46.119
Ah.

641
37:47.913 --> 37:50.499
I heard the gardener died, am I right?

642
37:51.500 --> 37:53.835
[chuckling]

643
37:54.294 --> 37:55.337
You getting cold feet?

644
37:56.171 --> 37:58.381
[Na-jung laughing]

645
37:58.465 --> 38:00.217
So what if the police know?

646
38:00.300 --> 38:02.385
The only thing I did was listen to you.

647
38:02.844 --> 38:06.098
And if Yoon Yi-jun wanted to sue you, I suppose you'd end up in jail.

648
38:09.392 --> 38:10.811
Tell me when you get out.

649
38:10.894 --> 38:11.895
[whimpers]

650
38:14.856 --> 38:15.690
[Si-hyun] Ms. Hye-jung.

651
38:15.774 --> 38:18.944
Long story short, you hid it from me because you didn't trust me enough.

652
38:19.986 --> 38:21.238
That's not it.

653
38:21.321 --> 38:23.782
It was because I didn't want to put you in danger.

654
38:24.908 --> 38:27.035
What the hell gave you the right to make that call?

655
38:27.119 --> 38:29.079
Why shouldn't I be able to make that call?

656
38:29.162 --> 38:32.290
Oh, so I should be grateful for any information

657
38:32.374 --> 38:33.375
you see fit to throw my way?

658
38:33.458 --> 38:35.293
No, I didn't mean it like that.

659
38:35.794 --> 38:37.629
You asked what we are to each other.

660
38:38.213 --> 38:39.464
We're two people…

661
38:40.757 --> 38:41.758
who don't trust each other.

662
38:42.425 --> 38:44.010
Look, I was worried for you. That's why!

663
38:44.427 --> 38:46.471
I'm worried that you might be in danger again like before,

664
38:46.555 --> 38:47.889
just 'cause you know more than you should!

665
38:47.973 --> 38:48.890
[phone buzzing]

666
38:52.727 --> 38:53.562
Answer it.

667
38:53.645 --> 38:56.189
You don't give a crap how I felt when I did that, am I right?

668
38:56.273 --> 38:58.984
-Who cares about a crummy call right now? -Answer the call.

669
38:59.067 --> 39:00.735
It might be an important one.

670
39:01.444 --> 39:02.904
Don't go anywhere.

671
39:05.282 --> 39:07.617
-[sighs] -Hey, if this isn't urgent, then…

672
39:11.037 --> 39:12.414
The dashcam had a backup?

673
39:14.666 --> 39:15.667
I understand.

674
39:22.007 --> 39:23.633
[exhales deeply]

675
39:25.051 --> 39:26.553
Someone's got it easy, huh?

676
39:29.181 --> 39:30.307
What are you gonna do?

677
39:30.849 --> 39:34.102
Thanks to that dumb GPS tracker, Hye-jung's going to dump me, you know?

678
39:35.228 --> 39:36.730
Ah, stop complaining.

679
39:41.151 --> 39:42.611
She hasn't dumped you yet.

680
39:43.069 --> 39:45.030
Hmm. Nah, that was you.

681
39:45.113 --> 39:47.199
Since you got rejected, then slapped by the chairman,

682
39:47.282 --> 39:48.950
and you're about to get married…

683
39:49.034 --> 39:51.536
You're feeling jealous of me, is that right? Huh? Is it?

684
39:55.832 --> 39:56.666
So…

685
39:57.125 --> 39:58.793
you're having trouble getting over Mr. Kang?

686
39:59.461 --> 40:01.963
Then just stop moping around and do what you do best.

687
40:02.047 --> 40:03.506
What am I supposed to…

688
40:04.090 --> 40:06.843
I mean, you're known as the big bad management strategy shark.

689
40:06.927 --> 40:07.928
Why are you being so modest?

690
40:08.011 --> 40:09.095
[sighs]

691
40:09.512 --> 40:11.389
I don't like taking things by force.

692
40:12.349 --> 40:14.935
Oh, you don't like to force things, huh?

693
40:15.477 --> 40:18.146
You want Mr. Kang Jae-hee to love you of his own volition?

694
40:22.859 --> 40:24.277
[tuts, inhales]

695
40:25.445 --> 40:26.321
So, uh…

696
40:27.656 --> 40:28.657
I was driving.

697
40:32.702 --> 40:34.496
The brakes weren't working,

698
40:35.789 --> 40:37.540
and we were on a collision course…

699
40:39.459 --> 40:42.295
but before I knew it… I swerved hard.

700
40:44.005 --> 40:45.632
Whether I got hurt or not…

701
40:47.425 --> 40:50.262
keeping Kang Jae-hee safe was all that was on my mind.

702
40:52.931 --> 40:53.932
I don't know…

703
40:54.015 --> 40:56.184
what it is about him that I like so much.

704
40:58.687 --> 40:59.688
[inhales]

705
41:00.563 --> 41:02.399
I wanna ask him why he did it.

706
41:04.651 --> 41:06.820
I want to ask him why he won't like me back

707
41:07.988 --> 41:09.864
in the way that I feel about him,

708
41:09.948 --> 41:11.992
but that's not an option open to me.

709
41:13.576 --> 41:15.161
'Cause it might drive him away.

710
41:18.164 --> 41:19.040
You know what?

711
41:21.710 --> 41:23.878
If it was something I could buy with money,

712
41:25.088 --> 41:27.090
I would have given everything that I had

713
41:28.341 --> 41:29.426
to win his heart.

714
41:31.219 --> 41:32.470
Well, it looks like…

715
41:34.556 --> 41:37.142
you found something you care for more than yourself.

716
41:39.853 --> 41:42.105
If it's any consolation, the line

717
41:42.188 --> 41:45.233
"How much do you need? Just name your price"

718
41:45.317 --> 41:47.569
didn't work out so well for Bin Hyung, either.

719
41:49.779 --> 41:51.448
[Si-hyun sighs] Jeez…

720
41:51.823 --> 41:53.742
all this heartbreak breaks my heart.

721
41:56.828 --> 41:59.122
Hey, please don't cry again after seeing this.

722
41:59.748 --> 42:01.207
You were a snot-covered wreck earlier.

723
42:02.625 --> 42:03.460
Look.

724
42:07.589 --> 42:09.632
[Si-hyun] I asked them to send over the backup

725
42:10.091 --> 42:11.843
-just in case we caught the perp's face. -[Jae-hee] It's you, isn't it?

726
42:11.926 --> 42:12.844
You're the real perp.

727
42:13.261 --> 42:15.096
I'm keeping this man safe.

728
42:16.222 --> 42:18.892
Meanwhile, the cops came through and nabbed the guy.

729
42:19.392 --> 42:20.602
I'd forgotten about it,

730
42:20.977 --> 42:23.146
but they just sent the cloud backup footage.

731
42:23.229 --> 42:24.230
[gasps softly]

732
42:25.607 --> 42:26.483
[groans]

733
42:27.192 --> 42:29.652
I told you, I won't let you do it. [grunts]

734
42:29.736 --> 42:31.488
[breathing heavily]

735
42:31.571 --> 42:33.990
[gentle pensive music playing]

736
42:38.703 --> 42:41.289
That's reckless, going up against a knife like that…

737
42:41.373 --> 42:43.500
Ask any company worker on the street

738
42:43.583 --> 42:45.668
if they'd take a knife for their boss.

739
42:45.752 --> 42:48.630
I bet nine out of ten would ask if they could stab their boss instead.

740
42:48.713 --> 42:50.673
[breathes heavily]

741
42:50.757 --> 42:52.342
You may have won him over already.

742
42:55.011 --> 42:56.012
[exhales shakily]

743
43:00.225 --> 43:02.018
Yoon Yi-jun's getting married,

744
43:03.103 --> 43:04.687
and I'll be taken off the case.

745
43:06.648 --> 43:08.316
Yeah, that's the best ending.

746
43:09.359 --> 43:10.735
That'll put things right.

747
43:11.027 --> 43:12.987
[rattling]

748
43:16.491 --> 43:19.285
[gasps] Oh, you wouldn't believe what happened!

749
43:19.369 --> 43:22.330
This one tomboy just popped out of nowhere in the dead of the night.

750
43:22.414 --> 43:24.040
She gave me such a fright.

751
43:24.374 --> 43:27.293
Ah, you know kids these days. They do whatever they want.

752
43:27.377 --> 43:29.796
You should set your son up on a blind date with her, right?

753
43:29.879 --> 43:31.047
It's about time they got married.

754
43:31.131 --> 43:32.799
Goodness, don't say that.

755
43:32.882 --> 43:35.051
My Gi-chan has a girlfriend now.

756
43:35.135 --> 43:36.970
A girl who also works for Taekang.

757
43:37.053 --> 43:38.012
[neighbors chuckle]

758
43:38.096 --> 43:40.932
I'm also going to marry Jae-hee off to a government employee like her.

759
43:41.015 --> 43:42.684
It's quite a sensible plan.

760
43:42.767 --> 43:44.727
That way, the two of them can live off their pension.

761
43:44.811 --> 43:46.229
-[door opens] -[Jae-hee] Mom.

762
43:54.654 --> 43:58.658
[groans] All they talk about is Taekang, Taekang.

763
43:58.741 --> 44:02.036
[scoffs] They're full of hot air. Bragging over nothing.

764
44:02.120 --> 44:04.706
As if working for Taekang is such a big deal.

765
44:04.789 --> 44:08.334
You can bring the heir to Taekang home and I wouldn't bat an eyelash.

766
44:08.960 --> 44:10.044
Hey, tell me…

767
44:10.128 --> 44:12.672
did you go around arresting all the bad guys in Korea?

768
44:13.173 --> 44:15.258
How'd this happen to your face, huh?

769
44:15.842 --> 44:17.635
Are you hurt anywhere else?

770
44:17.719 --> 44:18.970
I'm okay, I'm okay.

771
44:19.846 --> 44:20.847
Where's Dad?

772
44:22.974 --> 44:24.601
EXPERT ON ROMANCE

773
44:24.684 --> 44:26.603
-I take a warm shower first. -[light calm music playing]

774
44:27.353 --> 44:29.189
[Jae-hee's dad] Then use my favorite sheet mask.

775
44:29.689 --> 44:30.523
Oh…

776
44:30.607 --> 44:32.275
My skin loves this. It's lovely.

777
44:32.358 --> 44:34.068
Mm, moisturizing.

778
44:34.152 --> 44:35.820
I love my skin so much.

779
44:35.904 --> 44:36.738
After all.

780
44:36.821 --> 44:39.157
Then, I read a book before…

781
44:39.240 --> 44:41.534
mm… I fall into bed.

782
44:42.035 --> 44:43.536
Mwah! Good night.

783
44:43.620 --> 44:44.662
THE IRREVERSIBILITY OF BEING AND THE PROBLEM OF LIGHT

784
44:51.211 --> 44:52.128
[knocking on door]

785
44:53.129 --> 44:54.047
Who is it?

786
44:54.130 --> 44:54.964
[Jae-hee's dad] Princess.

787
44:55.632 --> 44:56.633
Hey, Pa!

788
44:59.093 --> 45:00.845
Princess, you still awake?

789
45:00.929 --> 45:02.305
-Yep. -Cool.

790
45:02.388 --> 45:03.306
-[plastic bag rustling] -Company?

791
45:03.389 --> 45:05.767
Mm… why not! [chuckles]

792
45:05.850 --> 45:07.310
[Jae-hee] You brought craft beer?

793
45:07.936 --> 45:10.355
-You went all out, huh? -[chuckles]

794
45:10.855 --> 45:12.357
I dipped into my slush fund.

795
45:12.690 --> 45:14.025
Hey, don't tell your mom, okay?

796
45:14.108 --> 45:15.652
Mm… let me call her.

797
45:15.735 --> 45:17.237
Where's my phone? Huh?

798
45:17.779 --> 45:18.613
Hey.

799
45:19.239 --> 45:21.157
[chuckles] Now wait, hang on, you.

800
45:21.866 --> 45:23.368
I got dirt on you. I'd rat you out.

801
45:23.451 --> 45:24.369
What?

802
45:24.452 --> 45:27.997
That handsome boss you recently had… The one who was pretty rich…

803
45:28.414 --> 45:30.333
You've been agonizing over him for a--

804
45:30.416 --> 45:31.334
[grunts] Hey!

805
45:31.417 --> 45:32.544
How did you know?

806
45:32.627 --> 45:33.962
Look, tell me who he is.

807
45:34.045 --> 45:35.129
I'll kick his butt!

808
45:35.213 --> 45:36.673
How dare he reject my baby girl!

809
45:36.756 --> 45:38.508
-[chuckles softly] -The absolute nerve.

810
45:39.467 --> 45:41.886
No, wait. He didn't, though. I wasn't rejected.

811
45:42.428 --> 45:43.263
Are you sure?

812
45:44.305 --> 45:46.224
Then why does my special girl look so sloppy and depressed?

813
45:47.809 --> 45:49.644
'Cause… he's getting married.

814
45:51.271 --> 45:52.438
[Jae-hee's dad sighs]

815
45:52.522 --> 45:53.356
Well…

816
45:54.315 --> 45:55.984
that's his way of rejecting you.

817
45:56.067 --> 45:57.193
You think so?

818
45:57.527 --> 45:58.361
Hold on,

819
45:58.444 --> 46:01.072
so that punk is gonna set you aside and marry someone else?

820
46:01.864 --> 46:02.699
Man…

821
46:03.199 --> 46:06.619
I ought to make a thumbnail of his face and post it… on my channel.

822
46:06.703 --> 46:07.912
Wait a sec…

823
46:07.996 --> 46:09.831
You just wanna boost your channel's view count!

824
46:09.914 --> 46:12.166
Not at all! It's about revenge.

825
46:12.250 --> 46:13.960
The number of views I'd get are second.

826
46:14.043 --> 46:16.379
What kind of dad sells out his daughter like that?

827
46:17.463 --> 46:20.174
Hey, anyway, just forget that crappy guy.

828
46:20.258 --> 46:21.759
He's not worth the energy.

829
46:23.428 --> 46:24.262
[can thuds]

830
46:24.762 --> 46:26.598
I just… feel kinda guilty.

831
46:27.640 --> 46:29.767
Thanks to me, he got caught up in a scandal

832
46:29.851 --> 46:31.269
and dragged through the mud.

833
46:32.604 --> 46:33.771
Someone slapped him.

834
46:35.189 --> 46:37.483
I didn't even get to tell him that I like him.

835
46:38.526 --> 46:40.528
[pensive music playing]

836
46:41.446 --> 46:42.363
Well…

837
46:43.156 --> 46:44.407
in our lives…

838
46:45.033 --> 46:47.452
there are some things you mustn't leave behind.

839
46:47.535 --> 46:48.453
[Jae-hee] Hmm?

840
46:49.621 --> 46:50.622
Food…

841
46:51.748 --> 46:52.915
and regrets.

842
46:55.501 --> 46:57.170
You've only got one life to live,

843
46:57.837 --> 47:00.882
and you've got me and your mom backing you up.

844
47:00.965 --> 47:04.802
So just let me and your mom take care of the fallout

845
47:05.428 --> 47:06.929
and just follow your heart.

846
47:09.265 --> 47:11.100
-Sound good? -Mm.

847
47:16.105 --> 47:17.523
You won't film it, will you?

848
47:17.607 --> 47:19.484
[scoffs] No, of course not.

849
47:19.567 --> 47:20.735
Ugh, really?

850
47:20.818 --> 47:22.111
It would make great content,

851
47:22.195 --> 47:23.404
-so if you're okay with it… -Ugh, are you kidding me right now?

852
47:23.488 --> 47:24.447
I…

853
47:24.864 --> 47:26.366
-Oh, I even teared up a little bit. -Come on.

854
47:26.449 --> 47:27.367
-Just go home! -[chuckles]

855
47:27.450 --> 47:29.535
-[Jae-hee's dad] Hey. -Go!

856
47:29.619 --> 47:31.120
[Jae-hee] Go home!

857
47:34.791 --> 47:36.668
ARTIST KO SPECIAL EXHIBITION MARRIAGE PROPOSAL

858
47:36.751 --> 47:38.002
AFTER SEVEN WINTERS HAVE PASSED

859
47:38.086 --> 47:39.420
BEST OF LUCK WITH YOUR EXHIBITION YEDID ART LAB MEMBERS

860
47:39.504 --> 47:41.089
NAON CONTEMPORARY ARTIST INVITATIONAL EXHIBITION

861
47:41.172 --> 47:42.674
WAY TO PRESS CONFERENCE ROOM

862
47:42.757 --> 47:45.968
[gentle piano music playing]

863
47:57.897 --> 47:59.482
[Si-hyun] I'm sorry to have to deliver the chairman's orders

864
47:59.565 --> 48:01.943
under these circumstances, Mr. Kang.

865
48:02.443 --> 48:05.279
As of today, we are terminating your employment,

866
48:06.239 --> 48:07.490
effective immediately.

867
48:10.535 --> 48:11.828
I'd been expecting this.

868
48:13.121 --> 48:13.955
Um…

869
48:15.289 --> 48:16.874
please do something for me.

870
48:16.958 --> 48:19.919
Sure. I'll do anything for you, hyung.

871
48:20.002 --> 48:21.003
-Huh? -Huh?

872
48:21.379 --> 48:22.380
-You just-- -Have you always been

873
48:22.463 --> 48:23.339
such a great fighter?

874
48:23.423 --> 48:25.049
-Huh? -Huh?

875
48:25.133 --> 48:26.384
Oh, the dashcam foo…

876
48:27.051 --> 48:28.386
Never mind. [chuckles awkwardly]

877
48:28.469 --> 48:30.054
Uh, you were saying?

878
48:30.138 --> 48:31.139
[inhales]

879
48:31.222 --> 48:33.391
Please, would you let me meet with Mr. Yoon?

880
48:34.350 --> 48:35.852
I need to tell him something…

881
48:36.853 --> 48:38.855
but he's been avoiding me for a while.

882
48:40.273 --> 48:41.733
Where is he right now?

883
48:41.816 --> 48:43.234
Uh, well, um…

884
48:46.237 --> 48:47.572
REAL ESTATE GIFT AGREEMENT

885
48:48.072 --> 48:49.157
PRENUPTIAL AGREEMENT

886
48:49.240 --> 48:50.575
[Si-a] My lawyer drew up this agreement

887
48:50.658 --> 48:52.994
after coordinating the opinions of both parties.

888
48:53.077 --> 48:55.913
The notary registration will be processed separately.

889
48:56.414 --> 48:57.415
So we each have one.

890
48:59.542 --> 49:02.253
[breathes deeply]

891
49:04.714 --> 49:05.673
YOON YI-JUN

892
49:06.507 --> 49:07.550
Wow.

893
49:14.098 --> 49:15.183
So that was today?

894
49:16.768 --> 49:20.104
Wow, so chaebols really draft up such things?

895
49:21.147 --> 49:23.649
And here I was, thinking there was some time before the wedding.

896
49:23.733 --> 49:25.026
Hey, look.

897
49:25.943 --> 49:27.069
I wouldn't normally say this.

898
49:27.153 --> 49:29.781
But watching the two of you makes me short of breath.

899
49:29.864 --> 49:31.449
Why are you guys so indecisive?

900
49:31.532 --> 49:33.451
You'd probably think he's a dating expert,

901
49:33.534 --> 49:36.078
but nope! He's got absolutely no idea!

902
49:36.162 --> 49:37.455
He said you like someone, right?

903
49:38.039 --> 49:39.290
You confessed your feelings,

904
49:39.373 --> 49:41.459
so why are you positively dripping with regret?

905
49:42.084 --> 49:43.252
-Then there's the thing… -Hold on a second.

906
49:43.336 --> 49:44.253
…with the dashcam footage…

907
49:44.337 --> 49:46.714
I confessed my feelings? So who did…

908
49:46.798 --> 49:47.882
That's what he told me.

909
49:47.965 --> 49:49.509
He was crying his eyes out…

910
49:49.592 --> 49:50.635
[inhales] A few nights ago

911
49:50.718 --> 49:52.303
-at your place, remember? -[Jae-hee] I…

912
49:52.386 --> 49:53.387
I'm in love…

913
49:58.059 --> 49:59.060
I'm in love…

914
50:00.853 --> 50:02.104
[gasps]

915
50:02.188 --> 50:03.231
How much of that did he hear?

916
50:03.314 --> 50:05.525
What do you mean, how much did he hear? I don't know.

917
50:05.608 --> 50:08.194
The crux of the matter is how much one's words and actions

918
50:08.277 --> 50:09.737
-can destroy a man. -Forget all that.

919
50:09.821 --> 50:11.948
Mr. Yoon's at the art center right now, right?

920
50:16.953 --> 50:18.037
Are you nuts?

921
50:18.120 --> 50:19.205
Give me your keys.

922
50:19.288 --> 50:21.290
Don't argue. I'm driving.

923
50:21.916 --> 50:23.626
[tires screeching]

924
50:28.798 --> 50:30.383
Car in front, car, car, car!

925
50:30.466 --> 50:32.218
-Hey, Mr. Kang, watch out for that car! -Then you better hold on!

926
50:32.301 --> 50:33.594
[Si-hyun] Huh? Whoa…

927
50:33.678 --> 50:34.637
-[tires screeching] -Whoa!

928
50:37.056 --> 50:38.766
Sounds like a conversation was overdue.

929
50:38.850 --> 50:40.017
Why'd you have to confuse him, huh?

930
50:40.101 --> 50:42.395
So what was I supposed to say when he never asked?

931
50:42.478 --> 50:43.646
He was totally avoiding me!

932
50:43.729 --> 50:47.066
Ugh, that idiot's crazy for you. It's obvious why he was being all cranky.

933
50:47.149 --> 50:48.109
I thought that was…

934
50:48.734 --> 50:50.570
because he found out that I lied to him.

935
50:50.653 --> 50:51.821
Lied to him about what exactly?

936
50:51.904 --> 50:53.739
Oh, wow, if it's bad, I think that I should know.

937
50:55.283 --> 50:56.659
Mr. Yoon didn't tell you about it?

938
50:56.742 --> 50:57.910
Ugh, about what?

939
50:57.994 --> 51:00.413
But he already knows. Even Ms. Lee knows the truth.

940
51:00.496 --> 51:02.164
Okay, so what's this secret that they know about

941
51:02.248 --> 51:03.958
that they ha-haven't let me in on?

942
51:05.835 --> 51:08.254
-I'm a woman. -Ah, don't be crazy, that's--

943
51:08.337 --> 51:09.672
-You have an Adam's apple! -[groans]

944
51:10.923 --> 51:12.008
Oh, you don't?

945
51:12.091 --> 51:13.759
It is exactly what it looks like.

946
51:14.176 --> 51:17.138
No Adam's apple. Double X chromosomes.

947
51:18.180 --> 51:19.181
Biologically…

948
51:20.224 --> 51:21.058
I'm a woman.

949
51:21.142 --> 51:22.310
For real…

950
51:22.393 --> 51:24.186
[upbeat music playing]

951
51:24.270 --> 51:25.479
…ma'am?

952
51:25.563 --> 51:27.356
-[engine accelerating] -Whoa!

953
51:27.440 --> 51:31.152
[Si-hyun screaming]

954
51:31.235 --> 51:33.779
I've received word that the articles have gone out.

955
51:34.572 --> 51:35.656
And Yi-jun?

956
51:35.740 --> 51:38.993
I've been told that he's… signed the contract.

957
51:39.869 --> 51:42.788
[tense music playing]

958
51:42.872 --> 51:44.206
[indistinct chatter]

959
51:44.290 --> 51:47.543
Wow, looks like everyone's come to kiss up to the future president's daughter.

960
51:47.627 --> 51:50.087
-[both chuckle] -[phones buzzing, chiming]

961
51:52.590 --> 51:54.967
They just released an official notice of Lee Si-a's wedding.

962
51:55.051 --> 51:57.219
She's getting married to Mr. Yoon Yi-jun.

963
51:57.303 --> 51:58.512
It says the wedding's in October.

964
51:59.472 --> 52:00.973
Oh! They're here!

965
52:01.057 --> 52:02.308
-[reporters clamoring] -[guard] Hey, hey, hey.

966
52:04.226 --> 52:07.063
-[camera shutters clicking] -[clamoring continues]

967
52:11.776 --> 52:13.194
[tires screeching]

968
52:18.074 --> 52:19.533
Holy crap! Are you an F1 driver?

969
52:19.617 --> 52:20.785
-[guard 1] You can't go in there! -[guard 2] Wait, stop, sir!

970
52:20.868 --> 52:21.744
[car door closes]

971
52:22.703 --> 52:23.955
[guard 3] You can't go inside.

972
52:24.038 --> 52:25.081
[man] Oh, he's a friend of mine.

973
52:25.498 --> 52:27.208
Oh. Yes, Mr. Ko.

974
52:27.875 --> 52:28.751
[guard 3] Sir.

975
52:30.211 --> 52:32.171
Oh, thanks so much.

976
52:32.254 --> 52:33.589
[Mr. Ko] I've heard a lot about you.

977
52:39.971 --> 52:42.098
-[camera shutters clicking] -[reporters clamoring]

978
52:42.181 --> 52:44.183
[reporter] Were you aware of the announcement, sir?

979
53:00.324 --> 53:03.244
The exhibition briefing will be in half an hour as planned.

980
53:03.327 --> 53:05.287
[reporter 1] Congratulations to you both. When is the wedding?

981
53:05.371 --> 53:07.957
[reporter 2] An official article covering your marriage just came out.

982
53:08.040 --> 53:10.126
Are you attending this event to support your future bride?

983
53:10.209 --> 53:11.877
[reporter 3] Did you have the presidential election in mind

984
53:11.961 --> 53:13.045
when you announced your wedding?

985
53:13.129 --> 53:15.464
[reporter 4] Where are you planning to hold the ceremony?

986
53:15.548 --> 53:17.800
Are you planning to get married at a Taekang Hotel?

987
53:17.883 --> 53:19.135
Please answer the question.

988
53:29.437 --> 53:31.939
[gentle music playing]

989
53:39.947 --> 53:41.032
That article is…

990
53:41.490 --> 53:43.617
-inaccurate. -[reporters murmuring]

991
53:49.081 --> 53:51.083
The two of us just…

992
53:51.167 --> 53:52.710
broke off our engagement.

993
53:54.837 --> 53:57.214
[reporter 1] You broke up? May I ask why?

994
53:58.007 --> 54:00.009
A scandalous photo of you and your secretary

995
54:00.092 --> 54:02.219
caused quite the stir in Taekang recently, Mr. Yoon.

996
54:02.303 --> 54:03.721
[reporter 2] You kissed your male secretary.

997
54:03.804 --> 54:06.432
How would you define your relationship? Are you lovers?

998
54:06.515 --> 54:08.726
-[reporter 3] Was the photo undoctored? -[reporter 4] Are you a homosexual?

999
54:08.809 --> 54:10.686
-[reporter 5] We'd like an explanation. -[reporter 6] Please, a word

1000
54:10.770 --> 54:12.313
on why you decided to call off the marriage.

1001
54:13.022 --> 54:14.356
The photo caused a stir, did it?

1002
54:14.440 --> 54:17.568
How did you get that photo in the first place? Care to explain?

1003
54:18.027 --> 54:19.445
How would I define my relationship?

1004
54:19.528 --> 54:20.946
He works for me. Next.

1005
54:21.363 --> 54:24.200
The photo was undoctored. And yes, I like him. Next.

1006
54:24.950 --> 54:26.410
Whether I'm gay or not

1007
54:26.494 --> 54:28.079
depends on the gender…

1008
54:29.163 --> 54:30.164
of the one I like.

1009
54:38.672 --> 54:41.008
[Si-a] Hmm. It's over.

1010
54:41.092 --> 54:41.926
YOON YI-JUN LEE SI-A

1011
54:42.009 --> 54:43.385
ENGAGEMENT TERMINATION AGREEMENT

1012
54:46.555 --> 54:48.766
What you gonna do now, Bachelor?

1013
54:50.476 --> 54:52.311
Now that everything's been settled,

1014
54:52.770 --> 54:54.105
I will hold her close.

1015
54:54.772 --> 54:56.607
You're such a softie.

1016
54:56.690 --> 54:58.359
She tricked you. Why do you like her?

1017
54:58.442 --> 54:59.860
She saved my life.

1018
55:00.402 --> 55:03.280
I gave up logical thought when it comes to her.

1019
55:04.073 --> 55:05.157
And what if she rejects you?

1020
55:05.241 --> 55:06.617
Then I guess I'll wait.

1021
55:08.285 --> 55:10.121
I'll continue to hope…

1022
55:10.204 --> 55:12.414
until she breaks up with that guy.

1023
55:12.498 --> 55:13.332
Ah…

1024
55:13.791 --> 55:16.877
I'm guessing the chairman might use a golf club this time.

1025
55:17.920 --> 55:18.921
He might.

1026
55:19.839 --> 55:21.549
I'm sure it'll all work out.

1027
55:24.009 --> 55:27.096
Thanks a lot for taking the heat off of me all this time,

1028
55:27.680 --> 55:28.848
Yoon Yi-jun.

1029
55:32.059 --> 55:33.269
Good luck.

1030
55:33.352 --> 55:36.063
[chuckles softly] You're starting to seem normal.

1031
55:36.564 --> 55:37.648
[chuckles softly]

1032
55:39.441 --> 55:41.610
-[reporter 1] Mr. Yoon, just a word. -[reporter 2] Sir.

1033
55:41.694 --> 55:43.028
[reporter 1] Please confirm whether you're doing this

1034
55:43.112 --> 55:44.405
for your same-sex secretary.

1035
55:44.488 --> 55:46.699
-[reporters clamoring] -[camera shutters clicking]

1036
55:52.621 --> 55:53.622
Hold on a minute.

1037
55:54.623 --> 55:55.499
I thought I saw…

1038
55:55.583 --> 55:56.584
[gasps softly]

1039
55:58.210 --> 56:00.129
So, I'll be groom-napping you momentarily.

1040
56:00.504 --> 56:01.547
Run on the count of three.

1041
56:03.340 --> 56:04.300
One…

1042
56:05.926 --> 56:06.760
[both] Three.

1043
56:06.844 --> 56:09.597
-[upbeat music playing] -[reporters clamoring]

1044
56:20.774 --> 56:21.942
[Si-a] Oh! Whoa!

1045
56:25.196 --> 56:26.530
Hello, my love.

1046
56:26.614 --> 56:29.158
[soft rhythmic music playing]

1047
56:29.241 --> 56:31.493
[camera shutters clicking]

1048
56:32.828 --> 56:33.829
[Si-a chuckles softly]

1049
56:35.414 --> 56:36.999
Looks like I'm newly single.

1050
56:37.458 --> 56:39.877
Do you wanna get married, Mr. Ko?

1051
56:41.420 --> 56:43.422
If so… sound like a plan?

1052
56:45.174 --> 56:47.384
[reporter 1] Are you in a relationship with Mr. Ko?

1053
56:47.843 --> 56:49.970
Did you break off the engagement because of him?

1054
56:50.054 --> 56:51.138
Please answer the question.

1055
56:51.222 --> 56:53.807
[reporter 2] How would the two of you define your relationship?

1056
56:53.891 --> 56:54.975
What is going on?

1057
56:56.477 --> 56:58.854
[upbeat romantic music playing]

1058
57:00.105 --> 57:02.024
-[Si-a squeals] -[both laughing]

1059
57:05.319 --> 57:07.488
[upbeat romantic music continues]

1060
57:29.260 --> 57:31.512
[both panting]

1061
57:38.686 --> 57:40.104
I'm so done…

1062
57:41.272 --> 57:42.481
hiding away

1063
57:43.482 --> 57:44.733
and staying silent

1064
57:45.526 --> 57:46.694
from here on out.

1065
57:49.446 --> 57:50.489
So, uh…

1066
57:52.241 --> 57:54.576
promise me to do things that will make your heart flutter.

1067
57:56.870 --> 57:57.871
You…

1068
58:03.585 --> 58:05.004
Your heart should only flutter for me.

1069
58:05.087 --> 58:07.506
[soft romantic music playing]

1070
59:09.318 --> 59:11.403
[Tae-sik] How long must I tolerate your insolence?

1071
59:11.487 --> 59:14.323
First, you hid that accountant. Now this.

1072
59:14.782 --> 59:15.866
We're almost there.

1073
59:17.993 --> 59:21.497
The slush fund will be returned before the shareholder meeting.

1074
59:22.998 --> 59:23.874
[Tae-sik] Hmm.

1075
59:25.125 --> 59:26.126
Who was it?

1076
59:28.337 --> 59:29.963
I suppose you have a good idea who.

1077
59:31.006 --> 59:32.633
Trust me when I tell you that…

1078
59:32.716 --> 59:34.968
I won't let Taekang become a punching bag

1079
59:35.511 --> 59:36.845
'cause of these allegations.

1080
59:36.929 --> 59:39.515
Sounds like you're threatening to do that if you don't get your way.

1081
59:39.598 --> 59:41.600
It's not a bad deal for you, either.

1082
59:42.810 --> 59:43.811
I guess…

1083
59:45.229 --> 59:46.814
it's all up to me, is it?

1084
59:46.897 --> 59:48.982
Taekang's the only thing you love in this world.

1085
59:49.358 --> 59:50.984
You wouldn't want to blemish its good name.

1086
59:51.360 --> 59:53.946
-Consider your blood pressure. -[sighs]

1087
59:54.029 --> 59:55.906
I'll make this all go away.

1088
59:55.989 --> 59:57.991
In exchange… [inhales]

1089
59:58.784 --> 01:00:00.452
…I'll get married when I want to,

1090
01:00:00.536 --> 01:00:02.371
and I'll marry the person I want to be with.

1091
01:00:07.584 --> 01:00:09.002
Jae-hee's one of my own.

1092
01:00:09.920 --> 01:00:11.630
So stop harassing him as well.

1093
01:00:12.881 --> 01:00:14.216
He means so much to me.

1094
01:00:15.217 --> 01:00:16.802
I can't get him out of my head.

1095
01:00:18.846 --> 01:00:21.765
[closing theme music playing]

1096
01:00:40.868 --> 01:00:41.785
SPECIAL THANKS TO CHOI HEE-JIN, KIM DO-YOON, JUNG YOO-MIN

1097
01:00:41.869 --> 01:00:42.786
PARK JUN-MUYN, KIM MIN-GUE FOR THEIR SPECIAL APPEARANCE

1098
01:00:42.870 --> 01:00:44.872
[handcuffs rattling, click]

1099
01:00:47.291 --> 01:00:48.625
[Jae-hee] Wanna get some ramyun or something?

1100
01:00:48.709 --> 01:00:49.710
[both laugh]

1101
01:00:49.793 --> 01:00:51.170
It's not like you're going into work, right?

1102
01:00:51.253 --> 01:00:52.921
Not this one. Not this one, either.

1103
01:00:53.005 --> 01:00:54.423
It looks like I'm trying too hard!

1104
01:00:54.506 --> 01:00:56.258
[Jae-hee] I wanted to try some normal things

1105
01:00:56.341 --> 01:00:57.551
-that everyone else gets to do. -[camera shutter clicks]

1106
01:00:57.634 --> 01:00:58.719
This…

1107
01:00:58.802 --> 01:00:59.720
This isn't a date.

1108
01:00:59.803 --> 01:01:01.388
[section chief] Looks like your team is going to be blamed for this.

1109
01:01:01.472 --> 01:01:04.933
With this, you'll be handing Yoon Yi-jun's leash to Father.

1110
01:01:05.017 --> 01:01:06.768
[Si-hyun] Hey, answer me, what's wrong?

1111
01:01:06.852 --> 01:01:07.686
So, what do you think?

1112
01:01:07.769 --> 01:01:08.729
-[Hye-jung] Can you handle the truth? -[doorbell chimes]

1113
01:01:09.188 --> 01:01:11.148
[Jae-hee] This means he's also in danger.

1114
01:01:11.231 --> 01:01:13.358
Meeting you wasn't a mere coincidence for me, you know.

1115
01:01:13.901 --> 01:01:15.068
[Yi-jun] It was a miracle.
